{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"powershell","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"PowerShell","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for PowerShell (.ps1 .psm1 .psd1).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"powershell","name":"PowerShell","extensions":[".ps1",".psm1",".psd1"],"grammar":"grammars/powershell.json","lineComment":"#","blockComment":["<#","#>"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"PowerShell","path":"snippets/powershell.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/powershell.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"<#\",\n      \"end\": \"#>\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\{?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_:]*\\\\}?\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][a-z]+-[A-Z][A-Za-z]+\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\s-[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9]*\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:dynamicparam|continue|function|workflow|finally|foreach|process|elseif|filter|hidden|return|static|switch|begin|break|catch|class|param|throw|until|using|while|data|else|enum|exit|from|trap|end|for|try|var|do|if|in)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:\\\\$false|\\\\$true|\\\\$null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Invoke-WebRequest|Invoke-RestMethod|ConvertFrom-Json|ForEach-Object|ConvertTo-Json|Get-ChildItem|Write-Warning|Select-Object|Import-Module|Start-Process|Write-Output|Where-Object|Get-Content|Set-Content|Remove-Item|Write-Error|Sort-Object|Write-Host|Copy-Item|Move-Item|Test-Path|Get-Item|Set-Item|New-Item|Out-File)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/powershell.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"func\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"function ${1:Verb-Noun} {\",\n      \"\\tparam(\",\n      \"\\t\\t[string]\\\\$${2:Name}\",\n      \"\\t)\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Foreach\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fe\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"foreach (\\\\$${1:item} in \\\\$${2:items}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"foreach\"\n  },\n  \"Try catch\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"try\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"try {\",\n      \"\\t$1\",\n      \"} catch {\",\n      \"\\tWrite-Error \\\\$_\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"try / catch\"\n  },\n  \"Pipeline filter\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wh\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:Get-ChildItem} | Where-Object { \\\\$_.${2:Name} -like \\\"${3:*}\\\" }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Where-Object\"\n  },\n  \"Param block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"param\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"param(\",\n      \"\\t[Parameter(Mandatory)]\",\n      \"\\t[string]\\\\$${1:Name}\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A param block\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# PowerShell\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for PowerShell.\n\n## Files\n\n`.ps1`, `.psm1`, `.psd1`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 5 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `func` | A function |\n| `fe` | foreach |\n| `try` | try / catch |\n| `wh` | Where-Object |\n| `param` | A param block |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}